  data: {
    LLM: "Keep track of the Queens and the King of Hearts. If you hold the King of Hearts, you must try to 'void' yourself in another suit so you can dump the King as soon as someone leads Hearts.\n\nDucking the 7th Trick: In Hand 6, count the tricks! If you are on trick 6 and you have a high card, play it now to avoid being forced to win trick 7.\n\nThe 'Reverse Void': In the Positive Hands (8-11), your objective flips. Try to trick your opponents into winning the low-value tricks so you can secure your bid.",
